        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Grimbeorn sets down a honey-pot the size of a cauldron* The day's work is done and paid, friend. The pelts are salted and the combs are in the press -- let the bees have their peace till the morrow. Come back in <CUSTOM6370>."
          }
        }
      },
