        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He counts on fingers thick as axe-hafts* How fares my father's garden? I make it <CUSTOM6371> warg pelts of the six, and <CUSTOM6372> hives of the three drawn. Break a hive open and the raiders will come to you -- they cannot help themselves."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 2,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
