          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Grimbeorn the Old looks up from a broken hive-board, and his eyes are not entirely a man's* Wargs in the bee-meadows -- a whole raiding pack of them, drunk on my father's honey and bolder every night. I have hives to mend and no hands to spare. Draw the honey from the three great hives about the homestead and the Carrock, kill six of the raiders the broken hives call in, and I will pay you from Beorn's own stores. Once each day, no more."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
