          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He grunts approval* Good. The hives stand in hollow stumps -- one here in the garden, two up on the Carrock heights. Crack one open and keep your blade loose: the wargs come running at the smell of broken comb. Six pelts and three combs, then find me here."
          }
        }
      },
