        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Grimbeorn looks you over the way a farmer weighs a spring lamb* No. These wargs have dragged down grown Beornings, and I will not send a green blade to feed them. Put twelve seasons of fighting behind you, then come ask me again about the garden."
          }
        }
      },
